  "details": "This module provides a field type for storing structured data with multiple sub-fields, along with several widgets including a *Search - autocomplete* widget.\n\nThe module\u2019s autocomplete endpoint does not sufficiently escape stored field values before returning them as suggestion labels, which can allow cross-site scripting.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that the attacker must have permission to edit an entity carrying a Data Field field. The *Search - autocomplete* widget must also be configured on that field.",
